  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Shrimp Cocktail",
  "description": "Cooking shrimp cocktail is easier than it seems. Chef John&#39;s recipe includes a spicy, horseradish-spiked cocktail sauce — a guaranteed crowd-pleaser.",
